OL,3,AUK economy grew 0.1% in August ahead of
OL,4,AHealey's first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's economy grew slightly in
OL,7,FAugust, according to the last set of
OL,8,Fofficial figures before John Healey's
OL,9,FBudget.
OL,11,FWith the chancellor planning to set out
OL,12,Fhis tax and spending plans at the end
OL,13,Fof the month, the Office for National
OL,14,FStatistics said the economy expanded by
OL,15,F0.1% in the month.
OL,17,FThe small increase follows growth of
OL,18,F0.4% in July, as well as positive
OL,19,Fupgrades to the outlook for Britain's
OL,20,Feconomy from global watchdog the
OL,21,FInternational Monetary Fund (IMF).
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
